    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive",
     "texto": [
      "**A fost restaurată** means \"was restored\". In Romanian, the participle agrees with the noun: *fațada restaurată*."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Interpretation",
     "texto": [
      "**A reprezenta** can mean \"to represent\" or \"to symbolise\". The guide explains which facts he knows and which interpretation he proposes."
